# cabin_moon_2: the moon at the first quarter (2 eighths of its month), lit on the right while waxing
# (lead call 54). Lamp light (24), so it stays bright at night; the dark
# limb isn't drawn, the sky shows there. The anchor, 0,0, is the
# disc's center (at_moon). 7 wide, 7 tall.
C 24  L 0,-3 1,-3  L 0,-2 2,-2  L 0,-1 3,-1  L 0,0 3,0  L 0,1 3,1  L 0,2 2,2
      L 0,3 1,3
